# Cosmogoyf {B}{G} */1+*: "power is equal to the number of cards you own in exile and its toughness is equal to that number plus 1." With nothing in exile it is 0/1.
# Bot1's Swords to Plowshares on its own Ornithopter exiles a card Bot1 owns: 1/2. On turn 3 Swords on Bot2's Memnite exiles a card BOT2 owns, which Bot1's Cosmogoyf
# does not count: still 1/2. On turn 5 Swords on Bot1's own Memnite makes it 2/3 (power and toughness each move by the one card).

